      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There is presently no recognised therapy for the painful legs and moving toes syndrome. Treatment by progabide, a GABA-agonist, was successful in one case: a gradual improvement was observed during four weeks and the movements have now disappeared after six months of progabide therapy."},
